      "cost": "1",
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The scout is wielding a net in two hands</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The scout makes a ranged Strike (with a [[/r 1d20+9 #Hurl Net]]{+9} modifier) against a Medium or smaller creature within 20 feet. On a hit, the target is Off-Guard and takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds. On a critical hit, the creature is Restrained instead. The DC to [[/act escape dc=16]]{Escape} the net is 16. A creature adjacent to the target can Interact with the net to remove it.</p>\n<p>Effect: Hurl Net</p>",
